{
  "//": [
    "The KitnaPay mark: four speed lines, a navy K and a coral P leaning into them.",
    "",
    "It is fitted to the supplied logo image rather than converted from a vector, so",
    "it is an approximation of that artwork - but a measured one. The outline is the",
    "half-coverage contour of the anti-aliased raster, fitted to cubic Beziers; the",
    "speed lines are built as tapered stadiums, which is what the artwork draws; and",
    "both gradients are the mean colour in bins along the axis that best explains the",
    "shading. Rendered back at the original size it differs from the artwork by about",
    "a pixel of outline and 7/255 of colour, the rest being a soft fold on the P that",
    "one linear gradient cannot carry.",
    "",
    "This file is the ONE drawing of the mark. BrandMark.tsx renders it in the app,",
    "web/src/components/brand/BrandMark.tsx renders the same JSON in the browser, and",
    "scripts/generate-brand-assets.js renders every PNG in assets/, web/public/ and",
    "store-listing/ from it, so the in-app logo, the launcher icon, the favicon and",
    "the store page cannot drift.",
    "",
    "Units: the mark is 1000 wide with its origin at its own top-left corner. Each",
    "part carries the box it occupies, so it can be drawn and animated as its own",
    "layer, and the parts are drawn in the order they appear here. The K paints over",
    "the right-hand end of speed lines 1 and 4, which in the artwork run into the",
    "stem: here they run all the way through it, because the animation grows each",
    "line from that end and it has to stay hidden until the line is long enough to",
    "read as a streak. Lines 2 and 3 stop short of the stem in the artwork and keep",
    "their round caps.",
    "",
    "The K and the P never overlap. In the artwork the K passes in front of the P and",
    "a white keyline separates them, so what is traced here is the P as it is seen -",
    "already cut. That keeps the gap in the geometry rather than in a white shape, so",
    "the mark works on any background and either letter can move on its own.",
    "",
    "navy and coral are the two brand colours, and theme/index.ts reads both as",
    "colors.primary and colors.accent - the UI and the mark beside it cannot drift",
    "apart. The gradients are userSpace, so one ramp runs across every part rather",
    "than restarting inside each box; a path with no paint is filled with navy.",
    "",
    "splashMarkWidth is the mark width in dp on the launch splash. The system splash",
    "shows adaptive-icon.png (mark 544 of 1024) at app.json imageWidth 288dp, so the",
    "mark is 288 * 544 / 1024 = 153dp there, and AnimatedSplash draws it at the same",
    "width so the hand-over does not jump. generate-brand-assets.js throws if the",
    "three stop agreeing."
  ],
